            @units = s  [UNIT: NX_TIME]
          FIELD /entry/instrument/height_piezo_sensor/spm_positioner/z_controller/K_i  shape=()  dtype=float64
            Value     : 3.67489e-10
            Concept   : NXpid_controller/ENTRY/INSTRUMENT/height_piezo_sensor/SPM_POSITIONER/z_controller/K_i  [OPTIONAL]
