                      the independently scanned controllers are listed under corresponding NXsensor
                      groups. Similarly, separate NXsensor groups are used to store the readings
                      from each measurement sensor. For example, in a temperature-dependent IV
                      measurement, the temperature and voltage must be present as independently
                      scanned controllers and the current sensor must also be present with its
                      readings.
